topic(["islam","general","d-av-sonstiges-islam-1","c-sklaven-to-ten-daif-hadithe"],{"title":"Sklaven töten daif hadithe","k":"Averroes","blurb":"1 post","article":{"claim":"Sklaven töten daif hadithe","tree":{"they":"Sklaven töten daif hadithe","we":"Jarir used to narrate from the Prophet [SAW]:\"If a slave runs away, no Salah will be accepted from him, and if he dies he will die a disbeliever.\" A slave of Jarir's ran away, and he caught him and struck his neck (killi…","more":{"h":"Sklaven töten daif hadithe","p":["Jarir used to narrate from the Prophet [SAW]:\"If a slave runs away, no Salah will be accepted from him, and if he dies he will die a disbeliever.\" A slave of Jarir's ran away, and he caught him and struck his neck (killing him)\nAbu Ghuddah : Shadh\nAl-Albani : Shadh\nZubair Ali Zai : Daif\n#4050\nSunan an Nasai 4050","It was narrated that Jarir said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'If a slave runs away to the land of Shirk, it becomes permissible to shed his blood\nAbu Ghuddah : Daif Isnaad\nAl-Albani : Daif Isnaad\nZubair Ali Zai : Daif\n#4052\nSunan an Nasai 4052","It was narrated from Jarir that:The Prophet [SAW] said: \"If a slave runs away to the land of Shirk, it becomes permissible to shed his blood\nAbu Ghuddah : Daif Isnaad\nAl-Albani : Daif Isnaad\nZubair Ali Zai : Daif\n#4053\nSunan an Nasai 4053","It was narrated that Jarir said:\"Any slave who runs away to the land of Shirk, it becomes permissible to shed his blood\nAbu Ghuddah : Daif Isnaad\nAl-Albani : Daif Isnaad\nZubair Ali Zai : Daif\n#4054\nSunan an Nasai 4054","It was narrated that Jarir said:\"Any slave who runs away to the land of Shirk, it becomes permissible to shed his blood\nAbu Ghuddah : Daif Isnaad\nAl-Albani : Daif Isnaad\nZubair Ali Zai : Daif\n#4055\nSunan an Nasai 4055","It was narrated that Jarir said:\"Any slave who runs away from his masters and joins the enemy, he has made it permissible to shed his blood\nAbu Ghuddah : Daif Isnaad\nAl-Albani : Daif Isnaad\nZubair Ali Zai : Daif\n#4056\nSunan an Nasai 4056"],"credit":"Averroes · sonstiges islam 1 › #sklaven-töten-daif-hadithe","link":"https://discord.com/channels/1275832106949283962/1275935298567671931"},"next":[]},"sum":"Notes from Averroes (sonstiges islam 1 › #sklaven-töten-daif-hadithe)."}});
