topic(["islam","proofs","d-ia-truthfulness-of-the-prophet"],{"title":"Truthfulness of the prophet","k":"Islamic Apologetics","blurb":"1 post from Discord","article":{"claim":"Truthfulness of the prophet","tree":{"they":"Truthfulness of the prophet","we":"Https://athari-archive.com/2025/03/25/ibn-taymiyyah-brings-many-proofs-of-the-prophets-trutfulness/ Ibn Taymiyyah Brings Many Proofs Of The Prophet's Truthfulness - AT...","more":{"h":"https://athari-archive.com/2025/03/25/ibn-taymiyyah-brings-many-proofs-of-the-prophets-trutfulness/","p":["https://athari-archive.com/2025/03/25/ibn-taymiyyah-brings-many-proofs-of-the-prophets-trutfulness/\nIbn Taymiyyah Brings Many Proofs Of The Prophet's Truthfulness - AT...\nIbn Taymiyyah Brings Many Proofs Of The Prophet's Truthfulness - AT...\nIbn Taymiyyah In Jawab Al Sahih presents an abundant amount of testimonies to the Prophet’s trutfulness from the People Of Mecca, and if he was known as trustoworthy throughout his life, before and after revelation. There is no reason to deny his prophethood. Testimonies Even the fiercest enemies of the Prophet (peace be upon him) […]","Qadr | قَدَر\n started a thread: The 632 Solar Eclipse: A Historical Confirmation in Hadith. See all threads.","Qadr | قَدَر\n started a thread: inspiration stories from the Seerah. See all threads."],"credit":"Islamic Apologetics · #truthfulness-of-the-prophet","link":"https://discord.com/channels/1514269918978248796/1515084550437605496"},"next":[]},"sum":"Notes from Islamic Apologetics (#truthfulness-of-the-prophet)."}});
topic(["islam","proofs","d-ia-prophecies-1"],{"title":"Prophecies 1","k":"Islamic Apologetics","blurb":"8 threads","children":{"t-siege-of-baghdad-prophecy":{"title":"Siege of baghdad prophecy","k":"IA","blurb":"3 posts from Discord","article":{"claim":"Siege of baghdad prophecy","tree":{"they":"Siege of baghdad prophecy","we":"Does the Prophet ﷺ Foretell the Mongol Sack of Baghdad?","more":{"h":"Does the Prophet ﷺ Foretell the Mongol Sack of Baghdad?","p":["Does the Prophet ﷺ Foretell the Mongol Sack of Baghdad?\nA narration of the Prophet ﷺ describes the rise of a great Muslim city and its eventual destruction by a people distinguished by their physical appearance. Many Muslim scholars and writers have associated this narration with the Mongol Sack of Baghdad (1258 CE).","What Does the Hadith Say?","The Prophet ﷺ said:","\"Some of my people will descend upon low lying ground which they will call al Baṣrah, beside a river called the Tigris, over which there will be a bridge. Its people will be numerous, and it will be one of the capital cities of the Muslims. At the end of times, the descendants of Qanṭūrāʾ will come with broad faces and small eyes, descending on the bank of the river...\"","The hadith continues by describing how the inhabitants will divide into three groups: those who flee and perish, those who seek safety and perish, and those who remain to fight, becoming martyrs.","Why Is This Narration Connected to Baghdad?\nMany Muslim scholars and researchers identify this narration with the Mongol siege of Baghdad.","Baghdad was founded during the Abbasid period and became the capital of the Muslim world. It was built along the Tigris River, grew into one of the largest cities of its time, and contained bridges connecting different parts of the city.","Some scholars also point to historical references to Bāb al Baṣrah, a well known district or gate of Baghdad, as an explanation for the hadith's mention of al Baṣrah."],"credit":"Islamic Apologetics · #prophecies 1 › siege-of-baghdad-prophecy","link":"https://discord.com/channels/1514269918978248796/1520830222008582215"},"next":[{"they":null,"we":"Who Were the Invaders? The hadith describes the attackers as the descendants of Qanṭūrāʾ, possessing broad faces and small eyes.","more":{"h":"Who Were the Invaders?","p":["Who Were the Invaders?\nThe hadith describes the attackers as the descendants of Qanṭūrāʾ, possessing broad faces and small eyes.","Many Muslim scholars have understood this description to refer to the Mongols, whose invasion of Baghdad in 1258 CE resulted in one of the greatest catastrophes in Islamic history.","During the siege, the city was overwhelmed, large numbers of its inhabitants were killed, and Baghdad ceased to function as the political and intellectual center of the Muslim world.","Why Do Muslims View This as a Prophecy?\nSupporters of this interpretation argue that the hadith combines several details:","• A major Muslim capital.","• A city located on the Tigris River.","• A large Muslim population.","• An invasion by a people described as having broad faces and small eyes.","• Widespread destruction and the death of many of the city's inhabitants.","They argue that these details closely correspond to the Mongol Sack of Baghdad, which occurred more than six centuries after the Prophet ﷺ.","Conclusion\nMany Muslims understand this narration as a remarkable prophecy concerning the Mongol destruction of Baghdad.","Others have discussed alternative interpretations of certain details within the narration. Nevertheless, the hadith has long been cited by Muslim scholars and apologists as evidence that the Prophet ﷺ foretold the rise of a great Muslim capital and its eventual devastation centuries before it occurred."],"credit":"Islamic Apologetics · #prophecies 1 › siege-of-baghdad-prophecy","link":"https://discord.com/channels/1514269918978248796/1520830222008582215"},"next":[{"they":null,"we":"Also read https://www.provingislam.com/proofs/mongols-sack-of-baghdad Siege of Baghdad Prophecy | Proving Islam Siege of Baghdad Prophecy | Proving Islam One of the most specific fulfilled prophecies in Islam: the Prophe…","more":{"h":"Also read","p":["Also read\nhttps://www.provingislam.com/proofs/mongols-sack-of-baghdad\nSiege of Baghdad Prophecy | Proving Islam\nSiege of Baghdad Prophecy | Proving Islam\nOne of the most specific fulfilled prophecies in Islam: the Prophet (ﷺ) described the Mongol Sack of Baghdad over 600 years before it happened.","also see Scans by @صَيَّامُ بْنُ عِرْفَانَ","https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1e6Q9IWA0vaIvf4Av6oUppsJJaFVjc5-LzM6IxmBIPD8/mobilepresent\nA remarkable, unambiguous and astonishing prophecy in regards to th...\nA remarkable, unambiguous and astonishing prophecy in regards to th...\nYear The descendants of Qantura' of broad faces and small eyes. A remarkable, astonishing prophecy that affirms the truth of Islam—let’s dissect! tiktok: islamcentralfx discord: https://discord.gg/6ysEnpW8xm 1) Now, the Prophet Muhammad, upon whom be peace mentions in this hadith that the city wi..."],"credit":"Islamic Apologetics · #prophecies 1 › siege-of-baghdad-prophecy","link":"https://discord.com/channels/1514269918978248796/1520830222008582215"},"next":[]}]}]},"sum":"Notes from Islamic Apologetics (#prophecies 1)."}},"t-examining-other-prophecies-and-predictions":{"title":"Examining other prophecies and predictions","k":"IA","blurb":"1 post from Discord","article":{"claim":"Examining other prophecies and predictions","tree":{"they":"Examining other prophecies and predictions","we":"We will compare Islamic prophecies with others' prophecies (Nostradamus, Verne, Bible etc.)","more":{"h":"We will compare Islamic prophecies with others' prophecies (Nostradamus, Verne, Bible etc.)","p":["We will compare Islamic prophecies with others' prophecies (Nostradamus, Verne, Bible etc.)"],"credit":"Islamic Apologetics · #prophecies 1 › Examining other prophecies and predictions","link":"https://discord.com/channels/1514269918978248796/1520830222008582215"},"next":[]},"sum":"Notes from Islamic Apologetics (#prophecies 1)."}},"t-roman-prophecy":{"title":"Roman prophecy","k":"IA","blurb":"2 posts from Discord","article":{"claim":"Roman prophecy","tree":{"they":"Roman prophecy","we":"By brother @Deleted User https://vm.tiktok.com/ZGdQ2GsUY/ TikTok · Azeem TikTok · Azeem Also see https://youtu.be/OitlzW6Iq4M?si=ScVmlamexLtLMKGg The Riskiest Prophecy by the Prophet (peace be upon him) The Riskiest Prop…","more":{"h":"By brother @Deleted User","p":["By brother @Deleted User","https://vm.tiktok.com/ZGdQ2GsUY/\nTikTok · Azeem\nTikTok · Azeem","Also see https://youtu.be/OitlzW6Iq4M?si=ScVmlamexLtLMKGg\nThe Riskiest Prophecy by the Prophet (peace be upon him)\nThe Riskiest Prophecy by the Prophet (peace be upon him)","https://www.openislam.wiki/posts/surah-al-rum-prophecy-refuted-answering-the-badr-hadith-and-ghalabat-reading-doubt/ \nSurah al-Rum Prophecy Refuted? Answering the Badr Hadith and “Gha...\nSurah al-Rum Prophecy Refuted? Answering the Badr Hadith and “Gha...","- - - - - - - - - - - - Surah al-Rum prophecy — also responds to the arguments it is false: Al-Mubarakfuri highlights the weakness in the hadith —…"],"credit":"Islamic Apologetics · #prophecies 1 › Roman prophecy","link":"https://discord.com/channels/1514269918978248796/1520830222008582215"},"next":[{"they":null,"we":"Https://sunnah.com/narrator/5647 Original report is weak because of this narrator.","more":{"h":"https://sunnah.com/narrator/5647 Original report is weak because of this narrator.","p":["https://sunnah.com/narrator/5647 Original report is weak because of this narrator.\nعطية بن سعد العوفي — ضعيف الحديث"],"credit":"Islamic Apologetics · #prophecies 1 › Roman prophecy","link":"https://discord.com/channels/1514269918978248796/1520830222008582215"},"next":[]}]},"sum":"Notes from Islamic Apologetics (#prophecies 1)."}},"t-prophecy-about-the-pharoah":{"title":"Prophecy about the Pharoah","k":"IA","blurb":"1 post from Discord","article":{"claim":"Prophecy about the Pharoah","tree":{"they":"Prophecy about the Pharoah","we":"Unbelievable prophecy from the Book of Allah (Qur'an) This will leave you speechless!","more":{"h":"Unbelievable prophecy from the Book of Allah (Qur'an)","p":["Unbelievable prophecy from the Book of Allah (Qur'an)","This will leave you speechless!","https://youtube.com/shorts/YUBTT-S5aPo\nQUR'AN PROPHECY ABOUT PHARAOH\nQUR'AN PROPHECY ABOUT PHARAOH","now we will prove why Ramses II was the Pharoah at the time of Musa (peace be upon him)","And also address the common objections to this Quranic prophecy"],"credit":"Islamic Apologetics · #prophecies 1 › Prophecy about the Pharoah","link":"https://discord.com/channels/1514269918978248796/1520830222008582215"},"next":[]},"sum":"Notes from Islamic Apologetics (#prophecies 1)."}},"t-bedouins-competing-in-construction":{"title":"Bedouins competing in construction","k":"IA","blurb":"1 post from Discord","article":{"claim":"Bedouins competing in construction","tree":{"they":"Bedouins competing in construction","we":"Https://www.provingislam.com/proofs/bedouins-prophecy#cite_note-1 Bedouins Prophecy | Proving Islam Bedouins Prophecy | Proving Islam A prophecy that came true in the past 15 years.","more":{"h":"https://www.provingislam.com/proofs/bedouins-prophecycitenote-1","p":["https://www.provingislam.com/proofs/bedouins-prophecy#cite_note-1\nBedouins Prophecy | Proving Islam\nBedouins Prophecy | Proving Islam\nA prophecy that came true in the past 15 years. This is the story of the Bedouins, the people who went from tents to skyscrapers in a single generation.","“The Hour will not be established until you see the barefoot, naked, destitute shepherds competing in making tall buildings. “Someone from the Prophet's companions asked who are those people and he replied, 'The Arabs.'”\n(Sahih Muslim 8a)","Those naked, barefoot and destitute shepherds were Bedouins, the Muslims knew this. Bedouins were the poorest community in all of Arabia","Today they are competing in the construction of tall buildings. The tallest building in the world (Burj Khalifa) is currently in Dubai, UAE. The UAE royal family are bedouins by tribe/descent.","Saudi Arabia is also actively constructing the Jeddah tower to surpass Burj Khalifa as the world's tallest building","The Saudi royal family also has Bedouin lineage!","The Current Crown prince and PM of Saudi Arabia, Muhammad bin Salman has Bedouin ancestry through both his paternal and maternal sides.","His mother, Fahda bint Falah Al Hithlaen, is the daughter of the head of the Al Ajman tribe, a prominent Bedouin clan in the Arabian Peninsula","His father, King Salman, was born to Fahda bint Falah, and his paternal grandfather, King Abdul Aziz (Ibn Saud), married women from Bedouin tribes, such as Nuf bint Nawwaf (from the Shammar confederation) and Fahda herself, to secure tribal alliances"],"imgs":1,"credit":"Islamic Apologetics · #prophecies 1 › bedouins-competing-in-construction","link":"https://discord.com/channels/1514269918978248796/1520830222008582215"},"next":[]},"sum":"Notes from Islamic Apologetics (#prophecies 1)."}},"t-fire-of-hijaz":{"title":"Fire of Hijaz","k":"IA","blurb":"1 post from Discord","article":{"claim":"Fire of Hijaz","tree":{"they":"Fire of Hijaz","we":"Narrated Abu Huraira: Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) said, \"The Hour will not be established till a fire will come out of the land of Hijaz, and it will throw light on the necks of the camels at Busra.\" (Bukhari and Muslim) https…","more":{"h":"Narrated Abu Huraira:","p":["Narrated Abu Huraira:","Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) said, \n\"The Hour will not be established till a fire will come out of the land of Hijaz, and it will throw light on the necks of the camels at Busra.\"\n(Bukhari and Muslim)","https://www.provingislam.com/proofs/fire-of-hijaz\nThe Fire of Hejaz | Proving Islam\nThe Fire of Hejaz | Proving Islam\nA great flame prophesized and fulfilled in a way that nobody expected. The fire of Hejaz prophecy explained."],"credit":"Islamic Apologetics · #prophecies 1 › Fire of Hijaz","link":"https://discord.com/channels/1514269918978248796/1520830222008582215"},"next":[]},"sum":"Notes from Islamic Apologetics (#prophecies 1)."}},"t-the-riskiest-prophecy-of-surah-masad":{"title":"The Riskiest prophecy of Surah Masad","k":"IA","blurb":"1 post from Discord","article":{"claim":"The Riskiest prophecy of Surah Masad","tree":{"they":"The Riskiest prophecy of Surah Masad","we":"تَبَّتْ يَدَآ أَبِى لَهَبٍۢ وَتَبَّ ١ May the hands of Abu Lahab be ruined, and ruined is he.","more":{"h":"تَبَّتْ يَدَآ أَبِى لَهَبٍۢ وَتَبَّ ١","p":["تَبَّتْ يَدَآ أَبِى لَهَبٍۢ وَتَبَّ ١","May the hands of Abu Lahab be ruined, and ruined is he.","مَآ أَغْنَىٰ عَنْهُ مَالُهُۥ وَمَا كَسَبَ ٢","His wealth will not avail him or that which he gained.","سَيَصْلَىٰ نَارًۭا ذَاتَ لَهَبٍۢ ٣","He will [enter to] burn in a Fire of [blazing] flame","وَٱمْرَأَتُهُۥ حَمَّالَةَ ٱلْحَطَبِ ٤","And his wife [as well] - the carrier of firewood.","فِى جِيدِهَا حَبْلٌۭ مِّن مَّسَدٍۭ ٥","Around her neck is a rope of [twisted] fiber.","https://youtu.be/-VjMiRDFQUY\nProofs of Prophethood #4: Prophecy about Abu Lahab the Uncle of the...\nProofs of Prophethood #4: Prophecy about Abu Lahab the Uncle of the...","https://youtube.com/shorts/j-iTxH1y5KY\nQur'an's Prophecy About Abu Lahab\nQur'an's Prophecy About Abu Lahab","https://youtube.com/shorts/Euruc6KLKEM\nAbu Lahab Could Have Ended Islam in Seconds... But Didn't 🤯 #All...\nAbu Lahab Could Have Ended Islam in Seconds... But Didn't 🤯 #All..."],"credit":"Islamic Apologetics · #prophecies 1 › The Riskiest prophecy of Surah Masad","link":"https://discord.com/channels/1514269918978248796/1520830222008582215"},"next":[]},"sum":"Notes from Islamic Apologetics (#prophecies 1)."}},"t-dhi-al-khalasa":{"title":"Dhi al Khalasa","k":"IA","blurb":"1 post from Discord","article":{"claim":"Dhi al Khalasa","tree":{"they":"Dhi al Khalasa","we":"Another Remarkable Prophecy of Muhammad ﷺ https://www.openislam.wiki/posts/prophecy-of-dhi-al-khalasa-idol-worshipped-again-in-history/ Prophecy of Dhi al-Khalasa: Idol Worshipped Again in History | Open...","more":{"h":"Another Remarkable Prophecy of Muhammad ﷺ","p":["Another Remarkable Prophecy of Muhammad ﷺ","https://www.openislam.wiki/posts/prophecy-of-dhi-al-khalasa-idol-worshipped-again-in-history/\nProphecy of Dhi al-Khalasa: Idol Worshipped Again in History | Open...\nProphecy of Dhi al-Khalasa: Idol Worshipped Again in History | Open...\nMuhammad ﷺ prophesied by name that the idol Dhi al-Khalasa would be worshipped again before the Hour — a prediction fulfilled centuries later when…","Kane\n changed the post title: Dhi al Khalasa","https://youtu.be/cQozFuC8UjU\nProving Islam in 3 Minutes (Dhul Khalasa Prophecy)\nProving Islam in 3 Minutes (Dhul Khalasa Prophecy)"],"credit":"Islamic Apologetics · #prophecies 1 › Dhi al Khalasa","link":"https://discord.com/channels/1514269918978248796/1520830222008582215"},"next":[]},"sum":"Notes from Islamic Apologetics (#prophecies 1)."}}}});
